# Units and docked ships in Quebec (45,24). DOS FUN_2f2b_628a takes a drop on the transport pane
# (region 8) only in cargo-drag mode 7: colonists and fence units drag in mode 6, so dragging a unit
# onto a ship never boards it. Units board a docked ship through Sentry ("Sentry / Board ship") and
# are picked up when the ship leaves the tile (FUN_1427_10be, units_ship_departure_pickup), as many
# as fit its free holds, the "Move to front" unit first. A passenger is never seen aboard a docked
# ship in the colony screen (arrivals go ashore on docking), so there is nothing to drag off one.
#
# Fixture: the base COLONY04 Quebec save with Caravel A (#83, empty, 2 holds) given its full
# allotment (JSON moves 12 -> 0, moves spent); Caravel B (#125) holds Tobacco 69 + Furs 39 (full).
# Fence units (icons y 119): #127 colonist x154, #135 Dragoon, #146 colonist, #91 soldier (fortified).
# Units Present row (y 163): Artillery #143 x220, #127 x237, Dragoon #135 x255, #146 x272, #91 x290.
# Caravel A icon (132,152), Caravel B icon (148,152), Caravel A hold 0 (132,171).
click 168 128              # open Quebec
wait 1
drag 154 119 132 152       # fence colonist #127 -> Caravel A icon: does not board (only selects #127)
drag 123 44 132 152        # Town Hall statesman -> Caravel A icon: nothing, he keeps working
drag 154 119 148 152       # fence colonist #127 -> full Caravel B icon: nothing
drag 154 119 132 171       # fence colonist #127 -> Caravel A's hold box: nothing
click 312 151              # multi pane: Units Present tab
wait 1
click 237 163              # select colonist #127
click 237 163              # second click: @UNITOPTIONS (Move to front / Sentry / Fortify)
click 110 106              # "Sentry / Board ship": #127 sentried (allotment spent)
click 255 163              # select Dragoon #135
click 255 163              # its @UNITOPTIONS
click 110 106              # Sentry: #135 sentried
click 272 163              # select colonist #146
click 272 163              # its @UNITOPTIONS
click 110 106              # Sentry: #146 sentried
click 272 163              # selected #146 again: @UNITOPTIONS
click 110 95               # "Move to front": #146 first in line for the next departing ship
key Escape                 # back to the map (View Pieces mode)
rclick 168 128             # View Pieces on Quebec
key a                      # Activate unit: the stack picker (Caravel A, Soldier, Caravel B, ...)
wait 1
key Down
key Down
key Return                 # row 2: full Caravel B
wait 1
key KP_9                   # B sails out to (46,23): no free hold, no sentried unit boards
wait 2
rclick 120 112             # View Pieces on Quebec (view origin 38,18: B's step does not recentre)
key a                      # stack picker: Caravel A heads it
wait 1
key Return                 # Caravel A
wait 1
key KP_9                   # A sails out to (46,23): #146 (moved to front) and #127 board, both holds;
wait 2                    # the sentried Dragoon #135 stays in Quebec (without the Move to front, #135 and #127 board)
shot
